        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic Studio Apartment to the rental market, located on Sundrive Road, Dublin 12.\nThe apartment has been recently renovated throughout and briefly comprises of a bright, open living space, with a fully fitted kitchen, washing machine, two attic storage spaces, a fully tiled bathroom and corner desk area. \nIn terms of location, Sundrive Road has all necessary amenities nearby including schools, shops, bars, restaurants, and sports & leisure facilities. Dublin City Centre is just 15 minutes' drive away and there is a bus stop right outside for direct bus links to the city and surrounding areas.\nViewing is highly advised!\nFeatures:\n1.Recently Renovated Throughout\n2.Bright & Open Living Space\n3.Fully Fitted Kitchen\n4.Ample On-Street Parking\n5.All Amenities Nearby\n6.Dublin Bus Stop Right Outside\n7.15 Minutes' Drive to Dublin City Centre\n8.Available Immediately\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRIES AS IT'S EASIER TO MANAGE. PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE — WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE.\n"
